Current Status: Down

Application for users to create their own stock watchlists and set email alerts

Modules hosted on AWS ECS + Farget:
    ./WatchlistAPI
    ./RabbitMQ
    ./AlertsPoller  
    ./AlertsEvaluator
    ./EmailSender

Modules stored on AWS S3:
    ./StockwatchIU

AWS RDS database:
    ./Database

System architecture:
    StockwatchUI --> watchlistAPI --> AWS RDS database
    AlertsPoller takes tickers from RDS database --> RabbitMQ --> AlertsEvaluator --> RabbitMQ --> EmailSender
